<title>USA: United Int'l buys Argentine TV companies.</title>
<headline>United Int'l buys Argentine TV companies.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colo. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>United International Holdings Inc said on Tuesday that it has acquired three cable television companies serving 61,000 subscribers in Bahia Blanca and Punta Alta, Argentina.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose the identity of the companies purchased or the seller. A spokesman said the information was not immediately available.</p>
<p>United International provides multi-channel television services and related businesses in 25 countries.</p>
